# Copy this to .env.beszel (gitignored — never commit the real key here).
# Consumed by docker-compose.yml's `beszel-agent` service via `env_file:`,
# kept separate from the main .env so this monitoring key doesn't need to
# travel with the app's own secrets (e.g. when syncing .env to another host).

# Public key for the beszel-agent service (system/container resource
# monitoring). Only obtainable after `beszel-hub` is running: open its
# dashboard (127.0.0.1:8090 on the host), add a new "system", and it
# generates this key for you to paste here. Only needed self-hosted.
KEY=
